                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Thanks for giving me the \"Game Over\" screen?  Did they all freaking die or something?\n\n(Note: Actually I found out from another player that this game is missing a Chapter...  Because this ain't the Collector's Edition...)\n\nThat means it's time to make our own sheet up!!!!!!\n\nThat aside...  I, myself, me, me, just me...  I actually liked the H.O.G.\n\nSure it was short...  Missing a Chapter...  And the items were rather hard to see in some parts, but...!\n\nI liked the individual equipment the other characters had...  Even though I didn't even need to use 'em lol.\n\nI liked going through the pyramid/temple and finding stuffs.\n\nIt was a rather relaxing experience...  But I wasn't fully zoned out...  So something there kept my interested, hmm...\n\nI only recommend this game to myself and other people who need to play EVERY...  SINGLE...  H.O.G. in existence.\n\nOtherwise?  Seriously...  Where is the last Chapter at?\n\n(And did anyone actually try the \"3D glasses mode\"?  I've never come in contact with such an item in real life and do not own a pair.)",
